          "Compute capability 7.5 is below 8.0, so vLLM's FlashAttention-2 backend is unavailable. Measured on vLLM 0.29 / T4: it selects TRITON_ATTN (candidates were TRITON_ATTN and FLEX_ATTENTION). Record which attention backend was active alongside every benchmark result - results are not comparable across backends.",
